#: scrnsave.cpp:175
msgid "Screen Saver"
msgstr "Skerm Bewaarder"

#: scrnsave.cpp:187
msgid ""
"This is a list of the available screen savers. Select the one you want to "
"use."
msgstr ""
"Hierdie is 'n lys van die beskikbaar skerm bewaarders. Kies die een jy wil "
"hê na gebruik."

#: scrnsave.cpp:191
msgid "&Setup..."
msgstr "Opstelling..."

#: scrnsave.cpp:195
msgid ""
"If the screen saver you selected has customizable features, you can set them "
"up by clicking this button."
msgstr ""
"As die skerm bewaarder jy gekose het pakmaakbaar funksies, jy kan stel hulle "
"begin deur te kliek hierdie knoppie."

#: scrnsave.cpp:198
msgid "&Test"
msgstr "Toets"

#: scrnsave.cpp:202
msgid ""
"You can try out the screen saver by clicking this button. (Also, the preview "
"image shows you what the screen saver will look like.)"
msgstr ""
"Jy kan probeer uit die skerm bewaarder deur te kliek hierdie knoppie. "
"(Asook, die voorskou beeld vertoon Jy wat die skerm bewaarder sal kyk hou "
"van.)"

#: scrnsave.cpp:213
msgid "Here you can see a preview of the selected screen saver."
msgstr "Hier jy kan sien 'n voorskou van die gekose skerm bewaarder."

#: scrnsave.cpp:215
msgid "Settings"
msgstr "Instellings"

#: scrnsave.cpp:222
msgid "Start screen saver a&utomatically"
msgstr "Begin skerm bewaarder automaties"

#: scrnsave.cpp:224
msgid ""
"When you check this option, the selected screen saver will be started "
"automatically after a certain number of minutes of inactivity. This timeout "
"period can be set using the spinbox below."
msgstr ""

#: scrnsave.cpp:233
msgid "After:"
msgstr "Na:"

#: scrnsave.cpp:239
msgid " minutes"
msgstr " minute"

#: scrnsave.cpp:240
msgid "1 minute"
msgstr "1 minuut"

#: scrnsave.cpp:247
msgid ""
"Choose the period of inactivity after which the screen saver should start. "
"To prevent the screen saver from automatically starting, uncheck the above "
"option."
msgstr ""
"Kies die periode van onaktiwiteit na wat die skerm bewaarder moet begin. Na "
"verhoed die skerm bewaarder van automaties beginne, ontkies die boonste "
"opsie."

#: scrnsave.cpp:253
msgid "Make the screen saver aware of power management"
msgstr ""

#: scrnsave.cpp:258
msgid ""
"Enable this option if you want to disable the screen saver while watching TV "
"or movies."
msgstr ""

#: scrnsave.cpp:260
msgid "&Require password to stop screen saver"
msgstr "Vereis wagwoord na stop skerm bewaarder"

#: scrnsave.cpp:265
msgid ""
"If you check this option, the display will be locked when the screen saver "
"starts. To restore the display, enter your account password at the prompt."
msgstr ""
"As jy bevestig hierdie opsie, die vertoon sal wees geslote wanneer die skerm "
"bewaarder beginne. Na herstel die vertoon, invoer jou rekening wagwoord na "
"die por."

#: scrnsave.cpp:272
msgid "&Priority:"
msgstr "Prioriteit:"

#: scrnsave.cpp:284
msgid ""
"Use this slider to change the processing priority for the screen saver over "
"other jobs that are being executed in the background. For a "
"processor-intensive screen saver, setting a higher priority may make the "
"display smoother at the expense of other jobs."
msgstr ""
"Gebruik hierdie skuiwer na verander die verwerking prioriteit vir die skerm "
"bewaarder bo ander werke wat word te wees uitgevoerde in die agtergrond. vir "
"'n processor-intensive skerm bewaarder, opset 'n hoër prioriteit dalk mag "
"maak die vertoon gladder na die ten koste van ander werke."

